 "pin_regs": {
  "enable": false,
  "reason": "Source-registered merged leaf: every rs input lands in a pin flop (iw / ie / iv / xf_q / neo_q / nwo_q / ci_q / sid_c and the capture copies) and every rs output leaves a relay flop (ro_* / vo / dl_* / nx_*); the x streamer's issuer input lands in the xg5 issuer relay then xs4 capture flops, xw_v / xw_d / fault leave flops. A recipe pin_regs stage would add an unpriced ring-hop edge (~8 cycles per traversal)."
 },
